{% from 'media.njk' import media %}
{% from 'research-card.njk' import researchCard %}
{% from 'writing-card.njk' import writingCard %}
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Research Engineer · Fraunhofer IVI</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Taehyoung <span>Kim.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">I’m a research engineer at Fraunhofer IVI working toward aerial autonomy. My work spans the path from data to deployment: collecting and curating aerial datasets, making multimodal annotation and training more efficient, and developing online perception and mapping alongside offline map reconstruction. I also work on getting these ideas running on real robots, bringing the models and software together into a working system.</p>
    <p class="hero-context">The goal is to enable aerial robots to perceive and act, supporting path planning, navigation, and mission execution. I’m also exploring reinforcement learning (RL), vision-language navigation (VLN), and vision-language-action (VLA) models toward end-to-end autonomy, connecting observations and instructions to learned actions.</p>
    <p class="hero-welcome">Here I share the research, experiments, and technical lessons that come out of that process.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#research">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#about">About me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="hero-socials"><a href="{{ site.scholar }}">Google Scholar</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="{{ site.github }}">GitHub</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/bio/">Bio</a></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-portrait">
    <img src="/assets/portfolio/media/taehyoung-800.webp" srcset="/assets/portfolio/media/taehyoung-480.webp 480w, /assets/portfolio/media/taehyoung-800.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 44px), (max-width: 800px) 42vw, 420px" width="800" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Taehyoung Kim standing on a cobbled lane beside ivy-covered walls and colorful street art.">
  </figure>
  <p class="hero-current"><span class="eyebrow">Current focus</span><span>Multimodal perception, mapping, and VLN/VLA for near-ground aerial autonomy.</span></p>
</section>

<section class="about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / A little about me</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">From an idea<br>to a working system.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>My research brings together video understanding, multimodal sensing, and semantic 3D mapping. I’m interested in connecting these ideas to perception systems that work beyond a benchmark.</p>
      <p>This site is a place to share that process: the papers, the experiments, and the practical things I learn while building. It also leaves room for side projects and ideas outside my day-to-day research.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/bio/">Read my bio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container activity-section" id="activity" aria-labelledby="activity-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / What I’ve been working on</p><h2 id="activity-title">Recent activity.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Recent papers and project updates. A small record of what I’m working on and sharing.</p></div>
  <ol class="activity-list">{% for update in activity %}
    <li><time datetime="{{ update.date.slice(0,7) }}">{{ update.date | activityMonth }}</time><div><p class="eyebrow activity-kind">{{ update.kind or 'Update' }}</p><h3>{% if update.url %}<a href="{{ update.url }}">{{ update.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% else %}{{ update.title }}{% endif %}</h3><p>{{ update.text }}{% if update.credits %} Kudos to {% for credit in update.credits %}{% if not loop.first %}{% if loop.last %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}<a class="activity-credit" href="{{ credit.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ credit.name }}</a>{% endfor %}. {{ update.creditNote }}{% endif %}</p></div>{% if update.images %}<div class="activity-photos">{% for image in update.images %}<img class="activity-image" src="{{ image.src }}" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ image.alt }}">{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</li>
  {% endfor %}</ol>
</section>

<section class="dark-section selected-research" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Research</p><h2 id="research-title">Selected research.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects.html">All research & projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="research-grid">
      {{ researchCard(publications[0], true) }}
      {{ researchCard(publications[1], true) }}
      {{ researchCard(publications[4]) }}
      {{ researchCard(publications[2]) }}
      {{ researchCard(publications[3]) }}
    </div>
    {% include 'fraunhofer-preview.njk' %}
    <div class="section-end"><span>Collaborative research, with full author credits on every paper.</span><a href="/publications.html">Full publication record <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" aria-labelledby="directions-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / The questions that connect it</p><h2 id="directions-title">Perceive. Represent.<br>Support decisions.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Three connected research directions. Distinct projects, shared questions about reliable robotic perception.</p></div>
  <div class="directions-grid">
    <article><span class="direction-number">01</span><h3>Real-time <br>perception</h3><p>How can a robot understand what it sees, consistently over time and across sensing modalities?</p><a href="/publications/ssp.html">Video perception / SSP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="direction-number">02</span><h3>3D scene <br>understanding</h3><p>How can semantic geometry become a more reliable representation of the world?</p><a href="/publications/voxelfix.html">Semantic mapping / VoxelFix <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="direction-number">03</span><h3>Aerial <br>autonomy</h3><p>How can perception support planning, and how should we evaluate an agent’s complete mission?</p><a href="/publications/missionbench.html">Mission evaluation / MissionBench <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container applied-preview" aria-labelledby="applied-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">05 / Beyond the paper</p><div class="applied-grid"><h2 id="applied-title">Research meets<br>real systems.</h2><div><p class="large-copy">My work sits at the intersection of computer vision, semantic mapping, and aerial robotics.</p><p>At Fraunhofer IVI, I work in a collaborative research environment where robotic perception connects with practical autonomous systems.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work.html">Explore collaborative projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</section>

{% if collections.posts.length %}
<section class="section container writing-preview" aria-labelledby="writing-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the notebook</p><h2 id="writing-title">Recent writing.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/writing.html">All writing ↗</a></div><div class="writing-grid writing-grid--home">{% for post in collections.posts | take(3) %}{{ writingCard(post, 3) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>
{% endif %}



<section class="contact-section container" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Ideas are better in conversation</p>
  <h2 id="contact-title">Let’s connect.<br><span>See where it leads.</span></h2>
  <div class="contact-interests">
    <div><h3>External PhD opportunities</h3><p>I’m looking for an external PhD position in robotic perception and aerial autonomy. If your group has a potential fit, I’d love to talk.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Research & project collaboration</h3><p>Have a research question or a project we could build together? I’m open to collaborations across perception, mapping, and autonomous systems.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Interesting opportunities</h3><p>I’m always open to a conversation about roles and teams doing thoughtful, ambitious work. If you think we could build something exciting together, get in touch.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Beyond research</h3><p>We don’t need a project to connect. I’m happy to meet new people, exchange ideas, or just have a good conversation. Say hello :)</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-bottom">
    <p>Pick the channel that feels right for you.<br>I’d be happy to hear from you.</p>
